{"id":"a2.u06","level":"A2","order":6,"title":{"en":"People and looks","ru":"Люди и внешность"},"description":"Описываем людей: как они выглядят и какие у них характеры. He is tall, she has long hair, What does she look like?, порядок прилагательных.","goals":["Могу описать внешность: She is tall and slim. She has long dark hair.","Могу описать характер: He is kind and quiet.","Могу спросить: What does she look like? What is he like?","Могу сказать, что человек выглядит усталым или счастливым: She looks tired.","Могу расставить прилагательные по порядку: a beautiful young woman.","Могу написать короткое описание человека."],"grammar":["a2.describing-people","a2.look-like","a2.adjective-order"],"troubles":["word-order"],"texts":[{"id":"a2.u06.sister","kind":"dialogue","genre":"conversation","title":{"en":"What does she look like?","ru":"Как она выглядит?"},"speakers":[{"id":"tom","name":"Tom","voice":"male"},{"id":"anna","name":"Anna","voice":"female"}],"lines":[{"speaker":"tom","en":"Anna, I am going to meet your sister at the station. What does she look like?","ru":"Анна, я собираюсь встретить твою сестру на вокзале. Как она выглядит?"},{"speaker":"anna","en":"She is tall and slim. She has long dark hair and brown eyes.","ru":"Она высокая и стройная. У неё длинные тёмные волосы и карие глаза."},{"speaker":"tom","en":"How old is she?","ru":"Сколько ей лет?"},{"speaker":"anna","en":"She is twenty-five. She wears glasses.","ru":"Ей двадцать пять. Она носит очки."},{"speaker":"tom","en":"What is she like?","ru":"А какая она по характеру?"},{"speaker":"anna","en":"She is kind and quiet, but she is shy. She is clever and funny too.","ru":"Она добрая и тихая, но застенчивая. Ещё она умная и смешная."},{"speaker":"tom","en":"OK. I will find her.","ru":"Хорошо. Я её найду."},{"speaker":"anna","en":"She will smile at you. You will see.","ru":"Она тебе улыбнётся. Сам увидишь."}],"glossary":[]},{"id":"a2.u06.twin","kind":"reading","genre":"article","title":{"en":"My twin brother","ru":"Мой брат-близнец"},"speakers":[],"lines":[{"en":"I have a twin brother. His name is Ivan. He is my best friend and I love him. We are twins: we are tall, with short dark hair and brown eyes.","ru":"У меня есть брат-близнец. Его зовут Иван. Он мой лучший друг, и я его люблю. Мы близнецы: мы высокие, у нас короткие тёмные волосы и карие глаза."},{"en":"But we are different. I am serious and quiet, and my boss says that I am honest and polite. Ivan is funny and friendly.","ru":"Но мы разные. Я серьёзный и тихий, и мой начальник говорит, что я честный и вежливый. Иван смешной и дружелюбный."},{"en":"He is never shy and he talks to new people. On Sunday he is lazy and sleeps late, but I am always busy. Now Ivan has a beard, and I don't.","ru":"Он никогда не стесняется и разговаривает с новыми людьми. В воскресенье он ленивый и долго спит, а я всегда занят. Теперь у Ивана борода, а у меня нет."}],"glossary":[]}],"lessons":[{"id":"a2.u06.l01","kind":"vocabulary","title":"Внешность и части тела","exercises":[{"id":"a2.u06.l01.e01","hint":"Tall и short — противоположные.","explanation":"Tall — высокий, short — низкий, slim — стройный, long — длинный, dark — тёмный.","difficulty":1,"words":["tall","short","slim","long","dark"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"tall","ru":"высокий"},{"en":"short","ru":"низкий"},{"en":"slim","ru":"стройный"},{"en":"long","ru":"длинный"},{"en":"dark","ru":"тёмный"}]},{"id":"a2.u06.l01.e02","hint":"Handsome — о мужчине.","explanation":"Blond — светловолосый, curly — кудрявый, handsome — красивый, pretty — симпатичная, beard — борода.","difficulty":1,"words":["beard","blond","curly","handsome","pretty"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"blond","ru":"светловолосый"},{"en":"curly","ru":"кудрявый"},{"en":"handsome","ru":"красивый"},{"en":"pretty","ru":"симпатичная"},{"en":"beard","ru":"борода"}]},{"id":"a2.u06.l01.e03","hint":"Части лица.","explanation":"Hair — волосы, eye — глаз, face — лицо, mouth — рот, ear — ухо.","difficulty":1,"words":["hair","eye","face","mouth","ear"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"hair","ru":"волосы"},{"en":"eye","ru":"глаз"},{"en":"face","ru":"лицо"},{"en":"mouth","ru":"рот"},{"en":"ear","ru":"ухо"}]},{"id":"a2.u06.l01.e04","hint":"Hand и arm — две руки.","explanation":"Hand — кисть, head — голова, arm — рука, leg — нога, twin — близнец.","difficulty":1,"words":["hand","head","arm","leg","twin"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"hand","ru":"рука"},{"en":"head","ru":"голова"},{"en":"arm","ru":"рука от плеча"},{"en":"leg","ru":"нога"},{"en":"twin","ru":"близнец"}]},{"id":"a2.u06.l01.e05","hint":"Волосы — с have.","explanation":"She has long dark hair. С she — has.","difficulty":1,"words":["hair","long","dark"],"grammar":["a2.describing-people"],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"ru","text":"У неё длинные тёмные волосы.","options":["She has long dark hair.","She is long dark hair.","She have long dark hair."],"answer":0},{"id":"a2.u06.l01.e06","hint":"Have — «иметь».","explanation":"He has a beard — «у него борода».","difficulty":1,"words":["beard"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"en","text":"He has a beard.","options":["У него борода.","Он бородатый человек.","Он носит бороду."],"answer":0},{"id":"a2.u06.l01.e07","hint":"Противоположное — short.","explanation":"Правильно: My brother is tall and slim.","difficulty":1,"words":["tall","short","slim","long"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"My brother is ___ and slim.","translation":"Мой брат высокий и стройный.","answers":[["tall"]],"options":["tall","short","long"]},{"id":"a2.u06.l01.e08","hint":"Волосы, которые завиваются.","explanation":"Правильно: She has curly hair.","difficulty":1,"words":["tall","slim","hair","curly"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"She has ___ hair.","translation":"У неё кудрявые волосы.","answers":[["curly"]],"options":["curly","tall","slim"]},{"id":"a2.u06.l01.e09","hint":"Родились вместе.","explanation":"Правильно: I have a twin brother.","difficulty":1,"words":["short","beard","twin"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I have a ___ brother.","translation":"У меня есть брат-близнец.","answers":[["twin"]],"options":["twin","beard","short"]},{"id":"a2.u06.l01.e10","hint":"Цвет глаз — карий.","explanation":"He has brown eyes and a beard — «у него карие глаза и борода».","difficulty":1,"words":["short","hair","eye","beard"],"grammar":["a2.describing-people"],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"He has brown eyes and a beard.","question":"Что вы слышите?","options":["He has brown eyes and a beard.","He has blue eyes and a beard.","He has brown eyes and short hair."],"answer":0},{"id":"a2.u06.l01.e11","hint":"Пять слов.","explanation":"She has long dark hair — «у неё длинные тёмные волосы».","difficulty":1,"words":["hair","long","dark"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_dictation","text":"She has long dark hair.","answers":[]},{"id":"a2.u06.l01.e12","hint":"Четыре буквы.","explanation":"Face [feɪs] — «лицо».","difficulty":1,"words":["face"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"лицо","answers":["face"]},{"id":"a2.u06.l01.e13","hint":"В одном слове гласный как в слове «хэр».","explanation":"Hair [her] — «волосы», here [hɪr] — «здесь».","difficulty":1,"words":["hair"],"grammar":[],"troubles":["pron-vowels"],"type":"minimal_pair","pair":[{"en":"hair","ipa":"her"},{"en":"here","ipa":"hɪr"}],"say":0},{"id":"a2.u06.l01.e14","hint":"Первый слог.","explanation":"HAND-some — ударение на первый слог.","difficulty":1,"words":["handsome"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"word_stress","word":"handsome","syllables":["hand","some"],"stress":0}]},{"id":"a2.u06.l02","kind":"vocabulary","title":"Характер","exercises":[{"id":"a2.u06.l02.e01","hint":"Слова про характер.","explanation":"Friendly — дружелюбный, kind — добрый, shy — застенчивый, quiet — тихий, clever — умный.","difficulty":1,"words":["friendly","kind","shy","quiet","clever"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"friendly","ru":"дружелюбный"},{"en":"kind","ru":"добрый"},{"en":"shy","ru":"застенчивый"},{"en":"quiet","ru":"тихий"},{"en":"clever","ru":"умный"}]},{"id":"a2.u06.l02.e02","hint":"Первые четыре — черты характера.","explanation":"Lazy — ленивый, polite — вежливый, serious — серьёзный, honest — честный, describe — описывать.","difficulty":1,"words":["lazy","polite","serious","honest","describe"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"lazy","ru":"ленивый"},{"en":"polite","ru":"вежливый"},{"en":"serious","ru":"серьёзный"},{"en":"honest","ru":"честный"},{"en":"describe","ru":"описывать"}]},{"id":"a2.u06.l02.e03","hint":"Люди вокруг нас.","explanation":"Neighbor — сосед, boss — начальник, look like — быть похожим, funny — смешной, twin — близнец.","difficulty":1,"words":["neighbor","boss","twin","look-like"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"neighbor","ru":"сосед"},{"en":"boss","ru":"начальник"},{"en":"look like","ru":"быть похожим"},{"en":"funny","ru":"смешной"},{"en":"twin","ru":"близнец"}]},{"id":"a2.u06.l02.e04","hint":"Говорит «пожалуйста» и «спасибо».","explanation":"Polite [pəˈlaɪt] — «вежливый».","difficulty":1,"words":["shy","lazy","polite"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"ru","text":"вежливый","options":["polite","lazy","shy"],"answer":0},{"id":"a2.u06.l02.e05","hint":"Не обманывает.","explanation":"Honest [ˈɑːnɪst] — «честный». Буква h не читается.","difficulty":1,"words":["honest"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"en","text":"honest","options":["честный","серьёзный","смешной"],"answer":0},{"id":"a2.u06.l02.e06","hint":"Не смеётся.","explanation":"Правильно: My boss is serious.","difficulty":1,"words":["lazy","serious","boss"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"My boss is ___. He never laughs at work.","translation":"Мой начальник серьёзный. Он никогда не смеётся на работе.","answers":[["serious"]],"options":["serious","lazy","funny"]},{"id":"a2.u06.l02.e07","hint":"Не любит работать.","explanation":"Правильно: My brother is lazy.","difficulty":1,"words":["lazy","polite","honest"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"My brother is ___. He sleeps late.","translation":"Мой брат ленивый. Он долго спит.","answers":[["lazy"]],"options":["lazy","polite","honest"]},{"id":"a2.u06.l02.e08","hint":"Смущается.","explanation":"Правильно: She is shy.","difficulty":1,"words":["friendly","shy","clever"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"She is ___ and does not talk to new people.","translation":"Она застенчивая и не разговаривает с новыми людьми.","answers":[["shy"]],"options":["shy","friendly","clever"]},{"id":"a2.u06.l02.e09","hint":"Живёт рядом.","explanation":"Правильно: My neighbor is a friendly woman.","difficulty":1,"words":["friendly","neighbor","boss","twin"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"My ___ is a friendly woman.","translation":"Моя соседка — дружелюбная женщина.","answers":[["neighbor"]],"options":["neighbor","boss","twin"]},{"id":"a2.u06.l02.e10","hint":"Строгий начальник.","explanation":"My boss is serious but polite — «мой начальник серьёзный, но вежливый».","difficulty":1,"words":["lazy","polite","serious","honest","boss"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"My boss is serious but polite.","question":"Что вы слышите?","options":["My boss is serious but polite.","My boss is funny and polite.","My boss is lazy but honest."],"answer":0},{"id":"a2.u06.l02.e11","hint":"Пять слов.","explanation":"She is kind and quiet — «она добрая и тихая».","difficulty":1,"words":["kind","quiet"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_dictation","text":"She is kind and quiet.","answers":[]},{"id":"a2.u06.l02.e12","hint":"Восемь букв.","explanation":"Describe [dɪˈskraɪb] — «описывать».","difficulty":1,"words":["describe"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"описывать","answers":["describe"]},{"id":"a2.u06.l02.e13","hint":"Второй слог.","explanation":"de-SCRIBE — ударение на второй слог.","difficulty":1,"words":["describe"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"word_stress","word":"describe","syllables":["de","scribe"],"stress":1},{"id":"a2.u06.l02.e14","hint":"Образец: She is… and…","explanation":"Ответ: She is kind and funny.","difficulty":3,"words":["kind","quiet","clever"],"grammar":["a2.look-like"],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_answer","question":"What is your best friend like?","questionRu":"Какой ваш лучший друг по характеру? Ответьте: He is kind and funny. She is quiet.","keywords":[["\\b(he|she|my friend) (is|are)\\b","\\bis\\b"],["\\b(kind|funny|quiet|shy|clever|lazy|polite|serious|honest|friendly)\\b"]],"minKeywords":2,"samples":["She is kind and funny.","He is quiet and clever."]}]},{"id":"a2.u06.l03","kind":"grammar","title":"He is tall, she has long hair","grammar":"a2.describing-people","exercises":[{"id":"a2.u06.l03.e01","hint":"Волосы — с have.","explanation":"Правильно: She has long dark hair.","difficulty":1,"words":["hair","long","dark"],"grammar":["a2.describing-people"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"She ___ long dark hair.","translation":"У неё длинные тёмные волосы.","answers":[["has"]],"options":["has","is","have"]},{"id":"a2.u06.l03.e02","hint":"Рост — с be.","explanation":"Правильно: He is tall and slim.","difficulty":1,"words":["tall","slim"],"grammar":["a2.describing-people"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"He ___ tall and slim.","translation":"Он высокий и стройный.","answers":[["is"]],"options":["is","has","have"]},{"id":"a2.u06.l03.e03","hint":"Борода — с have.","explanation":"Правильно: My brother has a beard.","difficulty":1,"words":["beard"],"grammar":["a2.describing-people"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"My brother ___ a beard.","translation":"У моего брата борода.","answers":[["has"]],"options":["has","is","wears"]},{"id":"a2.u06.l03.e04","hint":"Очки носят.","explanation":"She wears glasses. Очки и одежду — wear.","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["a2.describing-people"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"She ___ glasses.","translation":"Она носит очки.","answers":[["wears"]],"options":["wears","has","is"]},{"id":"a2.u06.l03.e05","hint":"Они — кто?","explanation":"Правильно: They are twins.","difficulty":1,"words":["twin"],"grammar":["a2.describing-people"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"They ___ twins.","translation":"Они близнецы.","answers":[["are"]],"options":["are","have","is"]},{"id":"a2.u06.l03.e06","hint":"Характер — с be.","explanation":"Правильно: My boss is serious.","difficulty":1,"words":["polite","serious","boss"],"grammar":["a2.describing-people"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"My boss ___ serious, but he is polite.","translation":"Мой начальник серьёзный, но вежливый.","answers":[["is"]],"options":["is","has","does"]},{"id":"a2.u06.l03.e07","hint":"Волосы — другой глагол.","explanation":"Правильно: She has long dark hair.","difficulty":1,"words":["hair","long","dark"],"grammar":["a2.describing-people"],"troubles":["word-order"],"type":"error_correction","text":"She is long dark hair.","wrong":"is","correction":"has","options":["has","have","wears"]},{"id":"a2.u06.l03.e08","hint":"Рост — другой глагол.","explanation":"Правильно: He is tall.","difficulty":1,"words":["tall"],"grammar":["a2.describing-people"],"troubles":["word-order"],"type":"error_correction","text":"He has tall.","wrong":"has","correction":"is","options":["is","are","have"]},{"id":"a2.u06.l03.e09","hint":"С she — другая форма.","explanation":"Правильно: She has blue eyes.","difficulty":1,"words":["eye"],"grammar":["a2.describing-people"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"error_correction","text":"She have blue eyes.","wrong":"have","correction":"has","options":["has","is","having"]},{"id":"a2.u06.l03.e10","hint":"Образец: Has + brown eyes.","explanation":"Правильно: He has brown eyes.","difficulty":1,"words":["eye"],"grammar":["a2.describing-people"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"У него карие глаза.","answer":"He has brown eyes.","alternatives":[],"distractors":["is","have"]},{"id":"a2.u06.l03.e11","hint":"Is + прилагательные.","explanation":"Правильно: She is tall and slim.","difficulty":1,"words":["tall","slim"],"grammar":["a2.describing-people"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Она высокая и стройная.","answer":"She is tall and slim.","alternatives":[],"distractors":["has","are"]},{"id":"a2.u06.l03.e12","hint":"Is и has.","explanation":"Правильно: My brother is tall and he has short dark hair.","difficulty":3,"words":["tall","short","hair","dark"],"grammar":["a2.describing-people"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Мой брат высокий, у него короткие тёмные волосы.","answers":["My brother is tall and he has short dark hair.","My brother is tall. He has short dark hair."]},{"id":"a2.u06.l03.e13","hint":"Какие волосы?","explanation":"My sister has curly hair — «у моей сестры кудрявые волосы».","difficulty":1,"words":["hair","long","curly"],"grammar":["a2.describing-people"],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"My sister has curly hair.","question":"Что вы слышите?","options":["My sister has curly hair.","My sister is curly.","My sister has long hair."],"answer":0},{"id":"a2.u06.l03.e14","hint":"Образец: He is… He has…","explanation":"Рост — is, волосы и глаза — has.","difficulty":3,"words":["tall","short","hair","eye","dark"],"grammar":["a2.describing-people"],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_describe","picture":{"emoji":"🧑"},"situation":"Опишите человека, которого вы хорошо знаете: рост, волосы и глаза.","keywords":[["\\b(he|she|my [a-z]+) (is|has)\\b"],["\\b(tall|short|slim|hair|eyes|beard|young|old)\\b"]],"minKeywords":2,"samples":["My brother is tall. He has short