 It is a beautiful old flat.","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["a2.adjective-order"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Это красивая старая квартира.","answer":"It is a beautiful old flat.","alternatives":[],"distractors":["old beautiful","are"]},{"id":"a2.u06.l05.e10","hint":"Образец: Pretty + young.","explanation":"Правильно: She is a pretty young girl.","difficulty":1,"words":["pretty"],"grammar":["a2.adjective-order"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Она симпатичная молодая девушка.","answers":["She is a pretty young girl."]},{"id":"a2.u06.l05.e11","hint":"Размер, потом цвет.","explanation":"Правильно: I have a small brown bag.","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["a2.adjective-order"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"У меня есть маленькая коричневая сумка.","answers":["I have a small brown bag."]},{"id":"a2.u06.l05.e12","hint":"Мнение, потом возраст.","explanation":"Правильно: He is a handsome young man.","difficulty":1,"words":["handsome"],"grammar":["a2.adjective-order"],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"He is a handsome young man.","question":"Что вы слышите?","options":["He is a handsome young man.","He is a young handsome man.","He is a handsome old man."],"answer":0},{"id":"a2.u06.l05.e13","hint":"Шесть слов.","explanation":"I have a big brown dog — «у меня большая коричневая собака».","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_dictation","text":"I have a big brown dog.","answers":[]},{"id":"a2.u06.l05.e14","hint":"Говорите плавно.","explanation":"Правильно: Beautiful [ˈbjuːtɪfəl], young [jʌŋ].","difficulty":1,"words":["hair","long","dark"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_repeat","text":"She is a beautiful young woman with long dark hair."}]},{"id":"a2.u06.l06","kind":"listening","title":"Как она выглядит?","textId":"a2.u06.sister","exercises":[{"id":"a2.u06.l06.e01","hint":"Слушайте внешность и характер сестры.","explanation":"Сестра Анн