во never стоит после be.","explanation":"Правильно: Ivan is never shy.","difficulty":1,"words":["shy"],"grammar":["a1.frequency"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"Ivan ___ never shy.","translation":"Иван никогда не стесняется.","answers":[["is"]],"options":["is","has","does"]},{"id":"a2.u06.l07.e04","hint":"Борода — с have.","explanation":"Правильно: Now Ivan has a beard.","difficulty":1,"words":["beard"],"grammar":["a2.describing-people"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"Now Ivan ___ a beard.","translation":"Теперь у Ивана борода.","answers":[["has"]],"options":["has","is","wears"]},{"id":"a2.u06.l07.e05","hint":"Две части с but.","explanation":"Правильно: I am serious and quiet, but my brother is funny and friendly.","difficulty":3,"words":["friendly","quiet","serious"],"grammar":["a2.describing-people"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Я серьёзный и тихий, а мой брат смешной и дружелюбный.","answers":["I am serious and quiet, but my brother is funny and friendly.","I am serious and quiet and my brother is funny and friendly."]},{"id":"a2.u06.l07.e06","hint":"Образец: My mother is… She has…","explanation":"Опишите внешность с is и has, характер — с is.","difficulty":3,"words":["tall","hair","dark","kind","quiet","serious"],"grammar":["a2.describing-people"],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_describe","picture":{"emoji":"👨‍👩‍👧"},"situation":"Опишите двух людей из вашей семьи: как они выглядят и какие у них характеры.","keywords":[["\\b(he|she|my [a-z]+) (is|has)\\b"],["\\b(tall|short|slim|hair|eyes|kind|quiet|funny|serious|shy|friendly)\\b"]],"minKeywords":2,"samples":["My mother is tall and she has dark hair. She is kind. My father is serious and quiet."]},{"id":"a2.u06.l07.e07","hint":"Образец: I am… I have…","explanation":"Ответ: I am tall and I have short hair.","difficulty":3,"words":["tall","short","hair","eye","look-like"],"grammar":["a2.describing-people"],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_answer","question":"What do you look like?","questionRu":"Как вы выглядите? Ответьте: I am tall. I have short dark hair.","keywords":[["\\bI (am|have)\\b"],["\\b(tall|short|slim|hair|eyes|beard|young)\\b"]],"minKeywords":2,"samples":["I am tall and I have short hair.","I have brown eyes."]},{"id":"a2.u06.l07.e08","hint":"План: кто → внешность → характер → сравнение.","explanation":"Внешность: is + рост, has + волосы и глаза. Характер: is + прилагательное. Для сравнения — but.","difficulty":3,"words":["tall","short","slim","hair","eye","beard","long","blond","dark","handsome","friendly","kind","shy","quiet","clever","lazy","polite","serious","neighbor","look-like"],"grammar":["a2.describing-people","a2.look-like","a2.adjective-order"],"troubles":[],"type":"write","task":"Опишите близкого человека: как он выглядит (рост, волосы, глаза) и какой у него характер. Сравните его с собой. Например: My friend is tall and slim. He has short dark hair. He is kind and funny, but I am quiet.","minWords":40,"maxWords":110,"criteria":[{"id":"looks","label":"Есть внешность: tall, hair, eyes","patterns":["\\b(tall|short|slim|hair|eyes|beard|young|old|blond|dark|curly|long)\\b"],"required":true},{"id":"has","label":"Есть has или have","patterns":["\\b(has|have)\\b"],"required":true},{"id":"character","label":"Есть характер: kind, quiet, funny","patterns":["\\b(kind|quiet|funny|shy|clever|lazy|polite|serious|honest|friendly)\\b"],"required":true},{"id":"contrast","label":"Есть сравнение: but или and","patterns":["\\b(but|and)\\b"],"required":true}],"commonErrors":[{"pattern":"\\b(is|are) (long|short|dark|blond|curly) (hair|eyes)\\b","message":"Волосы и глаза описывают с has или have: She has long hair."},{"pattern":"\\b(has|have) (tall|slim|kind|quiet|funny|shy|clever|lazy)\\b","message":"Рост и характер описывают с be: He is tall, she is kind."},{"pattern":"\\b(she|he) have\\b","message":"С he и she — has: she has long hair."},{"pattern":"\\bhow (does|do) [a-z]+ look like\\b","message":"Вопрос о внешности: What does she look like?"},{"pattern":"\\blooks like (tired|happy|sad|young|old)\\b","message":"После looks — прилагательное без like: she looks tired."}],"samples":["My friend Elena is tall and slim. She has long dark hair and brown eyes. She is kind and funny, but she is shy. I am quiet and serious. We look different, but we are good friends. She always smiles and she is polite.","My neighbor is a handsome young man. He is short and he has blond hair and a beard. He is friendly and clever. He looks like my brother. My brother is lazy on Sunday, but my neighbor is always busy."]}]}],"test":{"passScore":0.8,"exercises":[{"id":"a2.u06.test.e01","hint":"Смесь внешности и характера.","explanation":"Tall — высокий, beard — борода, kind — добрый, lazy — ленивый, boss — начальник.","difficulty":1,"words":["tall","beard","kind","lazy","boss"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"tall","ru":"высокий"},{"en":"beard","ru":"борода"},{"en":"kind","ru":"добрый"},{"en":"lazy","ru":"ленивый"},{"en":"boss","ru":"начальник"}]},{"id":"a2.u06.test.e02","hint":"Смущается незнакомых.","explanation":"Shy [ʃaɪ] — «застенчивый».","difficulty":1,"words":["shy","polite","honest"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"ru","text":"застенчивый","options":["shy","polite","honest"],"answer":0},{"id":"a2.u06.test.e03","hint":"Волосы.","explanation":"Правильно: She has long dark hair.","difficulty":1,"words":["hair","long","dark"],"grammar":["a2.describing-people"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"She ___ long dark hair.","translation":"У неё длинные тёмные волосы.","answers":[["has"]],"options":["has","is","have"]},{"id":"a2.u06.test.e04","hint":"Рост.","explanation":"Правильно: He is tall and slim.","difficulty":1,"words":["tall","slim"],"grammar":["a2.describing-people"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"He ___ tall and slim.","translation":"Он высокий и стройный.","answers":[["is"]],"options":["is","has","have"]},{"id":"a2.u06.test.e05","hint":"О в